+**Findings:**
+
+- **nit** — `engine/routing.go:150` fallback returns `Length` (implicit 1 m/s), mixing meters into a seconds-weighted graph. Unreachable today and documented as such; fine under the triage bar, but if a future constructor ever skips netfile validation, a mixed-unit graph would silently mis-route rather than fail. A panic would be louder; not worth a round.
