++// The recompute meter: with RerouteBudgetPerTick = 1 and TWO destinations
++// whose tables both go stale in the same epoch, one tick serves one fresh
++// table and one STALE one — the budgeted vehicle diverts, the other follows
++// the stale hop. Next tick's budget covers the second table.
++//
++// Black-box at the decision level; the budget counter and epoch stamps are
++// asserted white-box because they ARE the meter being specified.
